# Install Sysmon (Critical Telemetry Layer)

## Why this is needed

Right now Wazuh is only seeing:

- basic Windows logs

Sysmon adds:

- process creation
- command-line execution
- network connections
- malware-like behavior visibility

Without Sysmon → your SOC lab is weak

With Sysmon → your SOC lab becomes real

---

# STEP 1 — DOWNLOAD SYSMON

On Windows VM:

1. Open browser
2. Go to official Sysinternals:

[Sysmon (Microsoft Sysinternals)](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/sysinternals/downloads/sysmon?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

